<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;color:<%= t['ink-950'] %>;">Your AEO Corner data will be deleted on <%= closeDate %></h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">You cancelled the subscription for <strong><%= orgName %></strong>. Since then your account has been read-only: nothing is tracked, but everything you built is still there.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">On <strong><%= closeDate %></strong> we close the account. After a further 30 days everything in it is deleted, and it cannot be brought back.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">To keep it, choose a plan before then. Tracking starts again and your history is intact.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;"><a href="<%= billingUrl %>" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;background-color:<%= t['brand-600'] %>;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;border-radius:8px;">Choose a plan</a></p>
<p style="margin:0;color:<%= t['ink-700'] %>;">If you want your data first, reply to this email and we will send you an export.</p>
